  "description": "Shinobi is a Japanese-inspired display typeface that blends geometric structure with traditional brush-stroke influence, creating a bold and stylized Asian aesthetic. Designed for impactful headlines, restaurant branding, ninja-themed visuals, martial arts posters, retro samurai artwork, and cultural product packaging, this font delivers a strong identity rooted in Japanese visual language. \nRelevance and Use Cases is perfect for Japanese restaurant branding, samurai poster design, ninja game titles, Asian festival graphics, sushi packaging, martial arts event promotion, traditional cultural merchandise, anime-style editorial headers, travel tourism visuals, and retro Japanese streetwear identity.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Shinobi is a Japanese-inspired display typeface that blends geometric structure with traditional brush-stroke influence, creating a bold and stylized Asian aesthetic. Designed for impactful headlines, restaurant branding, ninja-themed visuals, martial arts posters, retro samurai artwork, and cultural product packaging, this font delivers a strong identity rooted in Japanese visual language. </p>\n<p>Relevance and Use Cases is perfect for Japanese restaurant branding, samurai poster design, ninja game titles, Asian festival graphics, sushi packaging, martial arts event promotion, traditional cultural merchandise, anime-style editorial headers, travel tourism visuals, and retro Japanese streetwear identity.</p>",
